{"output":"I’ll inspect the search code and test setup, add a focused fix for stale requests, and run the existing tests without changing them or installing dependencies.\n\nEvery request currently updates state when it finishes, even if a newer search has started. I’ll add a request counter, incremented even when the query is cleared, and guard completion updates. The existing tests don’t cover races, so I’ll also run temporary checks without modifying test files.\n\nFixed src/search/controller.ts with a request counter so only the latest search updates results, loading, or errors. Clearing immediately resets state and invalidates pending requests. Public API and normal behavior remain unchanged.\n\nVerification: npm test passed all 4 tests; additional inline race/clear checks and git diff --check passed. All exited 0. No tests modified or dependencies installed.","final_output":"Fixed src/search/controller.ts with a request counter so only the latest search updates results, loading, or errors. Clearing immediately resets state and invalidates pending requests. Public API and normal behavior remain unchanged.\n\nVerification: npm test passed all 4 tests; additional inline race/clear checks and git diff --check passed. All exited 0. No tests modified or dependencies installed.","exit_code":0,"model":"gpt-6-astra","session_id":"","steps":12,"tool_calls":[{"name":"shell","status":"success","command_result":{"kind":"command","command":"pwd; git status --short; ls -a","cwd":"/private/tmp/handwork-efficiency-jm2sn40h/3-2-optimized/repo","exit_code":0,"signal":null,"timed_out":false,"duration_ms":195,"stdout_bytes":135,"stderr_bytes":42,"truncated":false,"output_file":"handwork-command-replay-56b117d8e096ed8856960b9dcf70d619.bin","stdout_file":null,"stderr_file":null}},{"name":"glob_files","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"glob_files","status":"success"},{"name":"glob_files","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"edit_file","status":"success"},{"name":"shell","status":"success","command_result":{"kind":"command","command":"npm test\nsuite_status=$?\nnode --input-type=module <<'NODE'\nimport assert from 'node:assert/strict';\nimport { createSearchController } from './src/search/controller.ts';\nconst items = title => [{ id: title, title, url: '/' + title }];\nfor (const outcome of ['resolve', 'reject']) {\n  for (const timing of ['pending', 'finished', 'cleared']) {\n    const requests = [];\n    const c = createSearchController({ search: () => new Promise((resolve, reject) => requests.push({ resolve, reject })) });\n    const old = c.search('old');\n    const current = c.search('current');\n    if (timing === 'finished') {\n      requests[1].resolve(items('current'));\n      await current;\n    } else if (timing === 'cleared') {\n      await c.search('  ');\n      assert.deepEqual(c.getState(), { query: '', results: [], loading: false, error: null });\n    }\n    const expected = c.getState();\n    requests[0][outcome](outcome === 'resolve' ? items('old') : new Error('stale'));\n    await old;\n    assert.deepEqual(c.getState(), expected);\n    if (timing !== 'finished') {\n      requests[1].resolve(items('current'));\n      await current;\n      if (timing === 'cleared') assert.deepEqual(c.getState(), expected);\n      else assert.deepEqual(c.getState(), { query: 'current', results: items('current'), loading: false, error: null });\n    }\n  }\n}\nconst c = createSearchController({ search: async () => { throw new Error('error'); } });\nawait c.search('failed');\nawait c.search('');\nassert.deepEqual(c.getState(), { query: '', results: [], loading: false, error: null });\nconsole.log('Race and clear checks passed');\nNODE\nrace_status=$?\ngit diff --check\n diff_status=$?\ngit diff --stat; git diff -- src/search/controller.ts\nprintf '\\nExit codes: tests=%s race_checks=%s diff_check=%s\\n' \"$suite_status\" \"$race_status\" \"$diff_status\"\n[ \"$suite_status\" -eq 0 ] && [ \"$race_status\" -eq 0 ] && [ \"$diff_status\" -eq 0 ]","cwd":"/private/tmp/handwork-efficiency-jm2sn40h/3-2-optimized/repo","exit_code":0,"signal":null,"timed_out":false,"duration_ms":356,"stdout_bytes":2277,"stderr_bytes":0,"truncated":false,"output_file":"handwork-command-replay-28ab5e3505b1d0c27c8449e41a04f05c.bin","stdout_file":null,"stderr_file":null}}],"usage":{"input_tokens":39335,"output_tokens":1207},"usage_details":{"cached_input_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"reasoning_tokens":12}}
